---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { seo, site } from '../data/site';
import { analytics } from '../data/analytics';

/**
 * The existing approved policy, with one section that reflects reality
 * automatically: the storage and analytics paragraph changes depending on
 * whether a measurement ID is configured, so the policy cannot claim the site
 * is tracker-free after analytics are switched on.
 */
const analyticsEnabled = Boolean(analytics.measurementId);
---
<PageLayout
  title={seo.privacy.title}
  description={seo.privacy.description}
  heading={seo.privacy.h1}
  path="/privacy"
>
  <p>
    When you submit a form on this site (contact, intake, inquiry, or email signup), the
    information you enter — such as your name, email address, company, and message — is sent
    to us via Web3Forms, a form delivery service, so we can respond to you and deliver what
    you requested. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third
    parties for their marketing purposes.
  </p>

  <p>
    Payments are processed entirely by Stripe or PayPal on their own secure checkout pages.
    We never see, collect, or store your card or bank details. Stripe and PayPal handle your
    payment data under their own privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Storage in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    If you use the project builder to assemble a project, your selections are kept in your
    browser's session storage so they survive scrolling and a page refresh, and are sent to
    us only if you submit the inquiry form. They are cleared when you close the tab. The site
    also stores small amounts of data in local storage strictly for functionality, such as
    preventing duplicate form submissions. This data stays on your device.
  </p>

  {analyticsEnabled ? (
    <Fragment>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to understand which pages and services get attention.
        Analytics cookies are set only after you accept the cookie notice, and you can decline
        without losing any functionality. IP addresses are anonymised, and the data is not used
        for advertising or personalisation.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  ) : (
    <Fragment>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not use advertising cookies or third-party analytics trackers.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  )}

  <h2>Your information</h2>
  <p>
    To request access to or deletion of any personal information you have submitted, email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will respond promptly.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
